WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.592
It was a hot day.

2
00:00:09.593 --> 00:00:13.908
Nora opened the freezer and looked inside.

3
00:00:13.909 --> 00:00:20.227
"Dad. There's no ice cream!" she complained.

4
00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:24.046
Her father looked up from his computer.

5
00:00:24.047 --> 00:00:26.899
"Do you want to make some?"

6
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:30.648
"Homemade ice cream!" Nora cried.

7
00:00:30.649 --> 00:00:35.060
"Yes! Let's get started!"

8
00:00:35.061 --> 00:00:41.363
Nora helped her father gather all the ingredients.

9
00:00:41.364 --> 00:00:43.906
"Okay," Dad said.

10
00:00:43.907 --> 00:00:47.482
He was looking at a cookbook.

11
00:00:47.483 --> 00:00:50.146
"First we need egg yolks."

12
00:00:50.147 --> 00:00:59.403
Crack! Nora broke some eggs and scooped out the yolks.

13
00:00:59.404 --> 00:01:01.276
She put them in a bowl.

14
00:01:01.277 --> 00:01:05.705
Dad added sugar.

15
00:01:05.706 --> 00:01:13.473
Then he whisked everything together.

16
00:01:13.474 --> 00:01:23.787
Next Dad heated milk and vanilla in a pot.

17
00:01:23.788 --> 00:01:28.347
Then he slowly poured the liquid into the egg yolks.

18
00:01:28.348 --> 00:01:33.099
Nora stirred everything together.

19
00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:44.908
They cooked the mixture until it got thick.

20
00:01:44.909 --> 00:01:48.619
"Perfect," Dad said.

21
00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:52.559
"What's next?" Nora asked.

22
00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:56.390
"Now our mixture has to cool," Dad said.

23
00:01:56.391 --> 00:02:02.957
Nora sighed. "Will it take a really long time?"

24
00:02:02.958 --> 00:02:08.716
"Nope," said Dad.

25
00:02:08.717 --> 00:02:10.780
"Watch this."

26
00:02:10.781 --> 00:02:14.479
He put the pot in ice water.

27
00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:19.439
"It's cooling fast!" Nora said.

28
00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:23.297
"Yep."

29
00:02:23.298 --> 00:02:27.596
Dad took a cold container out of the freezer.

30
00:02:27.597 --> 00:02:31.755
"What's that for?" Nora asked.

31
00:02:31.756 --> 00:02:35.900
"It's for an ice cream machine," Dad said.

32
00:02:35.901 --> 00:02:39.660
"The machine will churn the mixture for us."

33
00:02:39.661 --> 00:02:44.077
"Cool!" Nora said.

34
00:02:44.078 --> 00:02:50.541
Dad showed Nora how to put the container into the machine.

35
00:02:50.542 --> 00:02:54.812
He poured in the mixture and Nora added heavy cream.

36
00:02:54.813 --> 00:02:57.602
Then they turned on the machine.

37
00:02:57.603 --> 00:03:07.100
Twenty minutes later Dad turned it off.

38
00:03:07.101 --> 00:03:11.572
He covered the container and put it back into the freezer.

39
00:03:11.573 --> 00:03:14.699
"Here comes the hard part," Dad said.

40
00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:18.601
"We wait!"

41
00:03:18.602 --> 00:03:22.116
"Ugh," Nora groaned.

42
00:03:22.117 --> 00:03:25.401
"I hate waiting."

43
00:03:25.402 --> 00:03:28.166
"Me too," said Dad.

44
00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:32.255
"So let's try to stay busy."

45
00:03:32.256 --> 00:03:35.432
Dad and Nora played cards.

46
00:03:35.433 --> 00:03:39.171
They kicked a soccer ball around.

47
00:03:39.172 --> 00:03:43.835
They went for a long bike ride through the neighborhood.

48
00:03:43.836 --> 00:03:48.486
Back at home Dad opened the freezer.

49
00:03:48.487 --> 00:03:51.933
Nora stood behind him on tiptoes.

50
00:03:51.934 --> 00:03:55.849
"Is it ready?" she asked eagerly.

51
00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:59.083
"Yes!" Dad said.

52
00:03:59.084 --> 00:04:06.005
He scooped some ice cream and they tasted it.

53
00:04:06.006 --> 00:04:10.457
"Mmm," Nora said, grinning.

54
00:04:10.458 --> 00:04:13.490
"I'm glad there was no ice cream in the freezer.

55
00:04:13.491 --> 00:04:23.008
Homemade ice cream is much better!"

